<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") %>

<style>
.legal-container {
  max-width: 860px;
  margin: 2rem auto 4rem auto;
  padding: 2.5rem;
  background: #ffffff;
  border-radius: 20px;
  border: 1px solid #eaeaea;
  box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
}

.legal-header {
  border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;
  padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
}

.legal-header h1 {
  font-weight: 800;
  font-size: 2rem;
  color: #222222;
}

.legal-section-title {
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  color: #222222;
  margin-top: 2rem;
  margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
}

.legal-text {
  color: #555555;
  line-height: 1.7;
  font-size: 0.95rem;
}
</style>

<div class="legal-container">
  <div class="legal-header">
    <h1>Security &amp; Safety</h1>
    <p class="text-muted small mb-0">Last updated: <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString("en-US", { month: "long", day: "numeric", year: "numeric" }) %></p>
  </div>

  <div class="legal-content">
    <p class="legal-text">
      Your safety and peace of mind are our top priorities at Wanderlust. We build robust security protocols and community guidelines to protect all hosts and guests.
    </p>

    <h3 class="legal-section-title">1. Host &amp; Guest Verification</h3>
    <p class="legal-text">
      We verify profiles and accounts to maintain trust across our community. Account authentication ensures that only legitimate users can host or book stays.
    </p>

    <h3 class="legal-section-title">2. Secure Communications</h3>
    <p class="legal-text">
      Always communicate through the Wanderlust platform to keep your sensitive personal details protected and maintain a verified record of your inquiries.
    </p>

    <h3 class="legal-section-title">3. Emergency Support</h3>
    <p class="legal-text">
      In the event of an urgent safety issue during your stay, contact local emergency services immediately and reach out to our dedicated support team at deveshc1012@gmail.com.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-top">
    <a href="/listings" class="btn btn-outline-dark rounded-pill px-4">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left me-1"></i> Back to Listings
    </a>
  </div>
</div>
